  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7862b722-63e7-5a08-bd94-9b2ae9a48fbf" activityNameId="7204db70-1de2-5be1-ac89-309be2e328a6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Oxide, for Li-ion NMC111 battery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Oxide, for Li-ion NMC111 battery
Original LCI reference from Crenna et al (2021). Towards more flexibility and transparency in life cycle inventories for Lithium-ion batteries. Geography: Data for global average oxide production; UUID: e2dc453e-4e0a-3c22-98e9-8b8b14c4529a
This dataset represents the production of 1 kg of oxide used e.g. for lihtium ion battery of an electric vehicle or portable consumer electronics. The inventory is modelled according to the publication of Crenna et al. (2021), in which a battery pack with gross pack energy of 23.5 kWh made of 140 3.6 V- 46Ah prismatic cells is presented. Cells are made of nickel-manganese-cobalt (NMC111) cathode and a graphite-based anode, liquid electrolyte and a porous plastic separator. Infrastructure is included as well in this dataset as "electronic component factory". This dataset is a copy of the corresponding regional dataset. Production volume was adjusted.;None;
Location: Data for global average oxide production
Technology: Oxide, lithium ion battery, NMC 111
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e2dc453e-4e0a-3c22-98e9-8b8b14c4529a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
